# title: Capital-protected note
# category: Structured notes
# underlyings: 1
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: The capital back for sure, plus a share of the stock's rise up to a cap: a zero-coupon bond and a call spread.
# param: notional = 1000 | amount | Notional
# param: participation = 0.8 | percent | Participation in the rise
# param: cap = 0.4 | percent | Cap on the performance
#
# Two years, 100% capital protection.

2027-01-04
    notional = 1000
    participation = 0.8
    cap = 0.4
    s0 = spot()

2029-01-04
    pays notional * (1 + participation * min(max(spot() / s0 - 1, 0), cap))
